---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
import JackBird from "../assets/JackBird.webp";
import JaneDoe from "../assets/JaneDoe.webp";
import JoanneWolf from "../assets/JoannaWolf.webp";
import JonasFish from "../assets/JonasFish.webp";
import OurTeam from "../assets/ourTeam.webp";
---

<Layout Page="AboutUs" Title="About Us">
  <section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-hero-title">
    <div
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-[1] h-[52%] bg-[linear-gradient(170deg,_rgba(247,247,247,1)_0%,_rgba(247,247,247,0.95)_42%,_rgba(247,247,247,0)_76%)]"
    >
    </div>
    <h1
      id="about-hero-title"
      class="about-hero-title text-hero font-black font-display text-light-primary mx-6 mb-6"
    >
      Not just a provider, but a partner<span class="text-brand">.</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="about-hero-image">
      <img fetchpriority="high" src={OurTeam.src} alt="Our team" />
    </div>
  </section>
  <p class="text-lg text-light-secondary font-sans m-6">
    We're a small team from Lagos — and we're tired of the same problem everyone
    else here is tired of. <br />
    Generators that break down. Fuel that runs out. Bills that keep climbing. For
    most of us, unreliable power isn't an inconvenience — it's a daily tax on getting
    things done. We've lived it ourselves, and we've watched it quietly drain the
    people and businesses that keep this city moving.
    <br /><br />
    PowerHop started with a simple conviction: the informal traders, workshop owners,
    and micro-businesses that make up the backbone of Lagos's economy deserve power
    that actually works — without the noise, the fumes, or the financial unpredictability
    of fuel. <br /> We're engineers, operators, and Lagos natives who've spent years
    working across energy, infrastructure, and technology. We didn't come here with
    a foreign solution looking for a market. We mapped Lagos feeder by feeder, listened
    to the people who'd be using our service, and built something around how the city
    actually works — not how it looks on paper. <br />We believe energy
    shouldn't be something you manage. It should just be there. That's what
    we're building — and we're building it here, with people from here, for
    people here.
  </p>
  <div>
    <h3
      class="font-sans capitalize text-light-primary text-2xl tracking-widest mx-6 mt-10"
    >
      MEET THE TEAM!
    </h3>
    <div
      class="mx-6 mt-6 mb-18 grid grid-cols-[minmax(100px,_250px)_minmax(100px,_250px)] gap-6 md:grid-cols-[minmax(100px,_250px)_minmax(100px,_250px)_minmax(100px,_250px)] lg:grid-cols-[minmax(100px,_200px)_minmax(100px,_200px)_minmax(100px,_200px)_minmax(100px,_200px)]"
    >
      <div class="employee">
        <img class="h-48 object-cover mb-4" src={JaneDoe.src} alt="Jane Doe" />
        <p class="font-mono text-light-primary capitalize text-2xl">Jane Doe</p>
        <p class="font-mono text-brand capitalize text-lg mb-4">Manager</p>
      </div>
      <div class="employee">
        <img
          class="h-48 object-cover mb-4"
          src={JackBird.src}
          alt="Jack Bird"
        />
        <p class="font-mono text-light-primary capitalize text-2xl">
          Jack Bird
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-brand capitalize text-lg mb-4">Engineer</p>
      </div>
      <div class="employee">
        <img
          class="h-48 object-cover mb-4"
          src={JonasFish.src}
          alt="Jonas Fish"
        />
        <p class="font-mono text-light-primary capitalize text-2xl">
          Jonas Fish
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-brand capitalize text-lg mb-4">Repairman</p>
      </div>
      <div class="employee">
        <img
          class="h-48 object-cover mb-4"
          src={JoanneWolf.src}
          alt="Joanne Wolf"
        />
        <p class="font-mono text-light-primary capitalize text-2xl">
          Joanne Wolf
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-brand capitalize text-lg mb-4">
          Customer support
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="text-hero font-black font-display m-6">
    <span text-light-primary>Want to join our mission</span><span
      class="text-brand">?</span
    >
  </h2>
  <p class="text-lg text-light-secondary font-sans m-6">
    We're always looking to expand our team of professionals. If you think you
    would fit in, feel free to reach out or send an application with your CV.
  </p>
  <p class="text-lg text-light-secondary font-sans m-6">
    WhatsApp: +249 123 456 7890 <br />E-mail: power@hop.ng
  </p>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: clamp(36rem, 78vw, 58rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #f7f7f7;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .about-hero-title {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .about-hero-image {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 5rem 0 0;
    z-index: 0;
    clip-path: polygon(0 18%, 100% 0, 100% 78%, 0 100%);
  }

  .about-hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center bottom;
  }

  .about-hero {
    margin-top: 0rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-hero-image {
      inset: 7rem 0 0;
      clip-path: polygon(0 12%, 100% 0, 100% 84%, 0 100%);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .about-hero {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
